/-!
# Algebraization for few generators over a Cohen–Macaulay complement

In Situation 0EHC (`A` Noetherian, `I ⊆ 𝔞`, `X = Spec(A)`, `Y = V(I)`, `Z = V(𝔞)`, `U = X \ Z`)
let `(ℱₙ)` be an object of `Coh(U, I𝒪_U)`. [Stacks, Tag 0EJP] says that `(ℱₙ)` extends to `X`,
and is the completion of a coherent `𝒪_U`-module when `A` is `I`-adically complete, provided

1. `A` is a local ring which has a dualizing complex,
2. all irreducible components of `X` have the same dimension,
3. the scheme `X \ Y` is Cohen–Macaulay,
4. `I` is generated by `d` elements,
5. `dim(X) - dim(Z) > d + 2`, and
6. for `y ∈ U ∩ Y` the module `ℱ_y^∧` is finite locally free outside `V(I𝒪_{X,y}^∧)`, for
   example if `ℱₙ` is a finite locally free `𝒪_U/Iⁿ𝒪_U`-module.

## Main results

* `Stacks.Algebraization.extendsToX_and_essImage_of_isCohenMacaulay_of_span_eq_range` —
  [Stacks, Tag 0EJP]: both conclusions.
* `Stacks.Algebraization.free_localizedModule_completedStalk_of_isFiniteLocallyFreeAdic`
  (in `StacksFrontier/AlgebraicGeometry/Algebraization/CohenMacaulayFreeDepthBound.lean`) — the
  example given in hypothesis (6).

## Proof

As in the source, hypotheses (1)–(6) give hypotheses (1), (2) and (3)(b) of [Stacks, Tag 0EJN]:
(3)(b) is `Stacks.Algebraization.depthAddDimAddDistance_gt_of_isCohenMacaulay_of_free`, and
`V(I) = V(f₁, …, f_d)` for the generators. [Stacks, Tag 0EJN] asks `d ≥ 1`; for `d = 0` the ideal
is zero and the system extends by `Stacks.Algebraization.extendsToX_of_pow_eq_bot`. Over an
`I`-adically complete base an extendable system is the restriction of a completion on `X`, hence
the completion of a coherent `𝒪_U`-module ([Stacks, Tag 0EIL]).

## Implementation notes

The hypotheses are spelled as in
`StacksFrontier/AlgebraicGeometry/Algebraization/CohenMacaulayFreeDepthBound.lean`: the dualizing
complex lives in an arbitrary model of the derived category; "all irreducible components of `X`
have the same
dimension" is `TopologicalSpace.Equidimensional (PrimeSpectrum A)` (Definition 0058, the
underlying space of `X`); "`X \ Y` is Cohen–Macaulay" is that every local ring `A_𝔮` with
`I ⊄ 𝔮` is a Cohen–Macaulay local ring (Definitions 02IO and 00N8); `I` generated by `d` elements
is `I = (f₁, …, f_d)` for some `f : Fin d → A`; `dim(X) - dim(Z) > d + 2` is
`dim(A/𝔞) + (d + 2) < dim(A)` in `WithBot ℕ∞`, with `dim(∅) = ⊥`; and (6) is freeness of the
localization of `ℱ_y^∧` at every prime off `V(I𝒪_{X,y}^∧)` — for the finite module `ℱ_y^∧` this
is finite local freeness on that open.

The conclusion is that of [Stacks, Tag 0EJN]: `(ℱₙ)`, read as the system
`Stacks.Algebraization.toKerSystem S F` along the pullback of the ideal sheaf of `Y`, extends to
`X` (`Stacks.Algebraization.ExtendsToX`, Definition 0EIM), and when `A` is `I`-adically complete
it lies in the essential image of the completion functor of `U`.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0EJP](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EJP)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0EJN](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EJN)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0EIY](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EIY)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0EIL](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EIL)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open AlgebraicGeometry CategoryTheory TopologicalSpace

universe u w

namespace Stacks.Algebraization

/-- **Stacks Project, Tag 0EJP.** In Situation 0EHC let `(ℱₙ)` be an object of `Coh(U, I𝒪_U)`.
Assume

1. `A` is a local ring which has a dualizing complex,
2. all irreducible components of `X` have the same dimension,
3. the scheme `X \ Y` is Cohen–Macaulay,
4. `I` is generated by `d` elements,
5. `dim(X) - dim(Z) > d + 2`, and
6. for `y ∈ U ∩ Y` the module `ℱ_y^∧` is finite locally free outside `V(I𝒪_{X,y}^∧)` (for
   example if `ℱₙ` is a finite locally free `𝒪_U/Iⁿ𝒪_U`-module, see
   `free_localizedModule_completedStalk_of_isFiniteLocallyFreeAdic`).

Then `(ℱₙ)` extends to `X`. In particular if `A` is `I`-adically complete, then `(ℱₙ)` is the
completion of a coherent `𝒪_U`-module. -/
@[stacks 0EJP "the whole statement: under hypotheses (1)-(6) the system extends to X, and over an \
I-adically complete A it is the completion of a coherent O_U-module; the example in (6) is \
free_localizedModule_completedStalk_of_isFiniteLocallyFreeAdic"]
public theorem extendsToX_and_essImage_of_isCohenMacaulay_of_span_eq_range
    (S : AlgebraizationSituation.{u}) [HasDerivedCategory.{w} (ModuleCat.{u} S.A)]
    [IsLocalRing S.A] (F : Stacks.Coherent.CoherentAdicSystems (idealOnOpen S))
    (hdual : ∃ K : DerivedCategory (ModuleCat.{u} S.A), Dualizing.IsDualizingComplex K)
    (hequi : Equidimensional (PrimeSpectrum S.A))
    (hCM : ∀ q : PrimeSpectrum S.A, ¬ S.I ≤ q.asIdeal →
      IsCohenMacaulayLocalRing (Localization.AtPrime q.asIdeal))
    (d : ℕ) (f : Fin d → S.A) (hI : S.I = Ideal.span (Set.range f))
    (hdim : ringKrullDim (S.A ⧸ S.a) + ((d + 2 : ℕ) : WithBot ℕ∞) < ringKrullDim S.A)
    (hfree : ∀ (y : S.U.toScheme) (z : S.Y), S.U.ι.base y = S.Yι.base z →
      ∀ p : PrimeSpectrum (completedLocalRing (idealOnOpen S) y),
        ¬ completedLocalIdeal (idealOnOpen S) y ≤ p.asIdeal →
        Module.Free (Localization.AtPrime p.asIdeal)
          (LocalizedModule p.asIdeal.primeCompl (completedStalk (idealOnOpen S) F y))) :
    ExtendsToX S (toKerSystem S F) ∧
      (IsAdicComplete S.I S.A →
        (completionFunctor S.U.toScheme (S.Yι.ker.comap S.U.ι)).essImage (toKerSystem S F)) := by
  have hext : ExtendsToX S (toKerSystem S F) := by
    rcases Nat.eq_zero_or_pos d with rfl | hd
    · have hbot : S.I ^ 1 = ⊥ := by
        rw [pow_one, hI, Set.range_eq_empty, Ideal.span_empty]
      exact extendsToX_of_pow_eq_bot S hbot (toKerSystem S F)
    · have hV : PrimeSpectrum.zeroLocus (S.I : Set S.A) =
          PrimeSpectrum.zeroLocus (Set.range f) := by
        rw [hI, PrimeSpectrum.zeroLocus_span]
      exact extendsToX_of_zeroLocus_eq_range_of_depthBound S F hdual d hd f hV
        (Or.inr fun y z hyz p hp =>
          depthAddDimAddDistance_gt_of_isCohenMacaulay_of_free S F hdual hequi hCM d hdim
            y z hyz p hp (hfree y z hyz p hp))
  refine ⟨hext, fun _ => ?_⟩
  exact (isCompletion_iff_ofRestriction S (toKerSystem S F)).mpr
    ((isCompletionOfRestriction_iff_isRestrictionOfCompletion S (toKerSystem S F)).mpr
      (isRestrictionOfCompletion_of_extendsToX S (toKerSystem S F) hext))

end Stacks.Algebraization

end
